{"title":"Career Roadmap · Business Analyst (Junior)","role":"Business Analyst (Junior)","summary":"A Junior Business Analyst (BA) helps organisations understand business problems, gather and document requirements, analyse processes and data, and translate business needs into actionable solutions for technology or operations teams.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BCA – Business Analytics / FinTech"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Business Analyst Intern, Business Analyst Trainee, Business Operations Analyst, Data/Business Analyst"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Junior Business Analyst, Business Analyst, Business Systems Analyst, FinTech Business Analyst"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Business Analyst, Product Analyst, Business Consultant, Product Owner"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Lead Business Analyst, Product Manager, Business Architect, Strategy/Transformation Lead"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA student specialising in Business Analytics / FinTech, this is a very strong career alignment. The student should combine business analysis + data analytics + SQL + Excel + finance/FinTech knowledge + communication + requirements engineering."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Very strong alignment."},{"type":"p","text":"A practical route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Business Analyst Intern","Business Analyst Trainee/Associate","Junior Business Analyst","Business Analyst","Senior Business Analyst","Lead BA / Product Owner / Business Consultant"]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Business fundamentals, Excel, communication, problem solving"},{"text":"Microsoft Excel","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"text":"Business analysis exercises + Excel workbook"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"SQL, statistics, financial fundamentals"},{"text":"SQLBolt","url":"https://sqlbolt.com/"},{"text":"SQL analysis project"},{"text":"Analytical foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Requirements gathering, process mapping, UML, documentation"},{"text":"Atlassian Agile Resources","url":"https://www.atlassian.com/agile"},{"text":"BRD + process map"},{"text":"BA fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Power BI, dashboards, data storytelling"},{"text":"Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"},{"text":"Interactive business dashboard"},{"text":"Analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Agile/Scrum, SDLC, Jira, stakeholder management"},{"text":"Atlassian Jira","url":"https://www.atlassian.com/software/jira"},{"text":"Agile case study"},{"text":"Delivery skills"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"FinTech, payments, banking, APIs, product analysis"},{"text":"Official financial/FinTech resources"},{"text":"FinTech product case study"},{"text":"Domain expertise"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Internship + specialised BA portfolio"},{"text":"Industry case studies"},{"text":"Internship + requirements portfolio"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"BA interviews, case studies, SQL, analytics"},{"text":"Practice cases + official resources"},{"text":"Resume + 3–5 BA case studies"},{"text":"Placement readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Business Analyst stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Business analysis fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem identification"},{"text":"Business objectives"},{"text":"Stakeholder analysis"},{"text":"Requirement elicitation"},{"text":"Requirement analysis"},{"text":"Requirement validation"},{"text":"Requirement prioritisation"},{"text":"Requirement documentation"},{"text":"Solution evaluation"},{"text":"Process improvement"},{"text":"Gap analysis"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Business cases"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business requirement","Functional requirement","Non-functional requirement","Technical requirement"]}]},{"heading":"Requirements engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to conduct:"},{"type":"h","text":"Requirement elicitation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Workshops"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Document analysis"},{"text":"Brainstorming"},{"text":"Stakeholder discussions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Requirement documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BRD"},{"text":"FRD"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Use cases"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"},{"text":"Process flows"},{"text":"Requirement traceability matrix"},{"text":"Product requirement documents"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A junior BA should be able to convert:"},{"type":"h","text":"“We need a better payment system.”"},{"type":"p","text":"into something measurable such as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business objective","user problem","requirements","acceptance criteria","success metrics"]}]},{"heading":"Process modelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flowcharts"},{"text":"BPMN"},{"text":"UML"},{"text":"Activity diagrams"},{"text":"Sequence diagrams"},{"text":"Use-case diagrams"},{"text":"Swimlane diagrams"},{"text":"SIPOC"},{"text":"As-Is process"},{"text":"To-Be process"},{"text":"Gap analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Current process","bottleneck","proposed process","expected benefit","KPI"]}]},{"heading":"Excel","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become highly comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulas"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"IF"},{"text":"SUMIFS/COUNTIFS"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"PivotCharts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Basic forecasting"},{"text":"Dashboard creation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Excel remains highly relevant for junior BA roles."}]},{"heading":"SQL","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL is one of the most valuable technical skills for a technology-oriented BA."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregation"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Data quality checks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use SQL to answer business questions:"},{"type":"p","text":"Which customers are leaving?"},{"type":"p","text":"Which products generate the highest revenue?"},{"type":"p","text":"Where are transactions failing?"},{"type":"p","text":"Which customer segment is most profitable?"}]},{"heading":"Power BI and data visualisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"DAX fundamentals"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Drill-down"},{"text":"KPI cards"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Data storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A BA should not create dashboards merely to make them visually attractive."},{"type":"p","text":"Every dashboard should answer:"},{"type":"flow","items":["What happened?","Why did it happen?","What should the business do?"]},{"type":"p","text":"Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"}]},{"heading":"Agile and Scrum","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product backlog"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Epics"},{"text":"Features"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"},{"text":"Sprint"},{"text":"Sprint planning"},{"text":"Daily stand-up"},{"text":"Sprint review"},{"text":"Retrospective"},{"text":"Definition of Done"},{"text":"Product backlog prioritisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example user story:"},{"type":"p","text":"As a customer, I want to receive a transaction confirmation so that I can verify that my payment was successful."},{"type":"p","text":"Then define measurable acceptance criteria."}]},{"heading":"Jira and collaboration tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Confluence"},{"text":"Microsoft Teams"},{"text":"Slack"},{"text":"Miro"},{"text":"Figma basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Jira to understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Epic","Story","Task","Bug","Sprint","Release"]},{"type":"p","text":"A BA should understand how requirements move through an actual development lifecycle."}]},{"heading":"FinTech domain knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because the degree includes FinTech, build additional knowledge in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Banking"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Savings/current accounts"},{"text":"Loans"},{"text":"Credit"},{"text":"Deposits"},{"text":"Interest"},{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"AML"},{"text":"Customer onboarding"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UPI"},{"text":"Cards"},{"text":"Payment gateways"},{"text":"Merchant payments"},{"text":"Payment processing"},{"text":"Settlement"},{"text":"Refunds"},{"text":"Chargebacks"},{"text":"Payment failures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"Wallets"},{"text":"Lending platforms"},{"text":"InsurTech"},{"text":"WealthTech"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Open banking concepts"},{"text":"Digital identity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk"},{"typ