igital banking experience"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Business process automation"},{"text":"Human-AI collaboration"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Evolve and stay relevant","text":"2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"The Business Analyst role is evolving from requirements documentation toward business problem solving and AI-assisted decision making."},{"type":"p","text":"Future-ready BAs should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted requirements analysis"},{"text":"Process mining"},{"text":"Intelligent automation"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Digital transformation"},{"text":"Cloud platforms"},{"text":"API ecosystems"},{"text":"FinTech infrastructure"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Business process automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future BA will increasingly operate between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business","Data","Technology","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong long-term profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Analysis","SQL/Analytics","FinTech","Product Thinking","AI"],"sep":"+"}]}]}